@VHSgunzo Turns out steamdeck users were not able to use the appimage because [steam preloads a bunch of libraries.](https://github.com/ValveSoftware/steam-for-linux/issues/7830) to all non steam apps/games. 

So the discord of Citron is full of Steam deck users asking why the appimage crashes when launched or in the case of @rrondo it would hang and make some horrible noise indefinitely. I just happened to find about all this mess because I checked the discord. 

So really please consider unsetting `LD_PRELOAD` by default and add something like `SHARUN_ALLOW_BROKEN` for the people that need that to work, which I don't think there is going to be a cause because this just breaks the appimages.

